{"created": "2019-04-25T18:53:11.901586+00:00", "modified": "2020-01-24T19:25:01.949556+00:00", "id": 2642801, "conceptrecid": "2642800", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.2642801", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.2642800", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2642801", "metadata": {"title": "National Weather Service Coded Surface Bulletins, 2003-", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.2642801", "publication_date": "2019-04-16", "description": "<p>The Coded Surface Bulletin dataset is a collection of ASCII files containing&nbsp;the locations of weather fronts, troughs, high pressure centers, and low pressure centers&nbsp;as determined by National Weather Service meteorologists at the Weather Prediction Center (WPC)&nbsp;during the surface analysis they do every three hours. Each bulletin is broadcast on the NOAAPort service, and has been available since 2003. The latitude/longitude precision&nbsp;in the initial version of the bulletin is 1&deg;. Beginning in 2009, a high-resolution version began to be distributed alongside the original version. The high-resolution version of the bulletin has a latitude/longitude precision of 0.1&deg;. The format and content&nbsp;of the original bulletin can be found at <a href=\"https://www.wpc.ncep.noaa.gov/html/read_coded_bull.shtml\">this link</a>. The format and content of the high-resolution bulletin can be found at <a href=\"https://www.wpc.ncep.noaa.gov/html/read_coded_bull_hr.shtml\">this link</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The bulletins within a rolling 2-week window can be obtained from the WPC at <a href=\"https://ftp.wpc.ncep.noaa.gov/coded_sfc/\">this link</a>. The files in this dataset were provided by WPC personnel from an internal archive.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "National Weather Service", "affiliation": "NOAA", "orcid": "0000-0002-2952-2828"}], "contributors": [{"name": "Biard, James C", "affiliation": "North Carolina Institute for Climate Studies - North Carolina State University", "type": "Researcher", "orcid": "0000-0002-2952-2828"}, {"name": "Robson, Alan", "affiliation": "NWS WPC", "type": "DataManager"}], "keywords": ["weather", "fronts", "meteorology", "atmosphere", "pressure centers", "NWS", "WPC"], "subjects": [{"term": "cold front", "identifier": "http://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Cold_front", "scheme": "url"}, {"term": "warm front", "identifier": "http://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Warm_front", "scheme": "url"}, {"term": "quasi-stationary front", "identifier": "http://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Quasi-stationary_front", "scheme": "url"}, {"term": "occluded front", "identifier": "http://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Occluded_front", "scheme": "url"}, {"term": "pressure center", "identifier": "http://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Pressure_center", "scheme": "url"}, {"term": "airmass analysis", "identifier": "http://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Airmass_analysis", "scheme": "url"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.2646544", "relation": "isReferencedBy", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-sa-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "2642800"}}]}}, "title": "National Weather Service Coded Surface Bulletins, 2003-", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/2642801", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/2642801", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/2642801?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2642801", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2642801", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.2642801", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/2642801/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/2642800", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/2642800", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2642800", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.2642800", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/recor